sequenceDiagram
    actor Tenant
    participant API as Tenant API
    participant Service as Case service
    participant DB as Case store
    participant WF as Native Workflow
    participant Claude as Anthropic Claude API
    Note over Tenant,API: Starts with a confirmed intake or an update to a linked case
    Tenant->>API: Confirm report or submit case update
    API->>Service: Intake or evidence with stable retry key
    Service->>DB: Commit source, event, initial assessment and wake intent
    API-->>WF: Start or signal after commit
    WF->>Service: Fresh run_case_cycle
    Service-->>WF: Unread message holds action; triage due
    WF->>Service: triage_case_messages
    Service->>Claude: Stored source and bounded case context
    alt Claude returns a valid reading
        Claude-->>Service: Route, source quotes, assertions and ambiguities
        Service->>DB: Commit checked interpretation and unverified assertions
    else Claude unavailable, refused or invalid
        Service->>DB: Record failure and route triage to staff
    end
    WF->>Service: Fresh run_case_cycle
    opt Tenant questions are due
        WF->>Service: compose_tenant_messages
        Service->>Claude: Open questions, policy and recent context
        Claude-->>Service: Question draft and send recommendation
        Service->>Service: Check identity, route, topics and risk
        alt Deterministic send checks pass
            Service->>DB: Record simulated in-app message
        else Staff review or required fact missing
            Service->>DB: Hold draft for staff
        end
    end
    WF->>Service: Fresh policy cycle; simulate only if ACT
    Service-->>WF: Checkpoint and next wake deadline
    WF->>WF: Wait on typed hook or absolute timer
